        <item>
            <title>2.24.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 15:34:29 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>105</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.24.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes

Telling the agent to create a worktree and move into it changes the session's working directory, and Claude Code moves the session's transcript along with it. Canopy kept looking in the directory the session started in, so four things went quietly wrong. All four are fixed.

- **A session that entered a worktree no longer disappears from Save and Quit.** It was treated as having no transcript on disk and silently dropped from the restored layout.
- **The sidebar row, pane header and status bar now show the branch the session is actually on**, instead of the one it started on.
- **Generated session titles no longer come from an empty conversation history**, which is what produced contentless names for sessions that had moved.
- **The message count in the status bar no longer reads zero** for a session that moved.
]]></description>
