        <item>
            <title>2.24.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 13:33:00 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>104</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.24.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The sidebar and pane header now show the branch each session is actually on, read from git or jj, instead of guessing it from the worktree folder name. A session in a repository's root names its branch too, so two panes on the same repository can be told apart at a glance.
- The peer-name chip's border now hangs into the margin so its text lines up with the title and project lines above and below it.

### Bug Fixes
- A worktree whose folder name no longer matched its branch showed the stale folder name as if it were the branch — after switching branches inside the worktree, or when the branch name contained a `/` that was flattened to `-` in the directory name.
- A detached checkout rendered a branch pill reading "HEAD", which names nothing. It now shows no branch at all. This was reachable in a git worktree of a jj repository, where the jj probe misses because the linked worktree has no `.jj` directory of its own.
]]></description>
